    "lawCode": "Amd §2, Chap 606 of 2006",
    "lawSection": "Volunteer Firefighters' Benefit",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S4149\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 606 of the laws of 2006 amending the volunteer\nfirefighters' benefit law relating to creating a presumption relating\nto certain lung disabilities incurred by volunteer firefighters, in\nrelation to the effectiveness of such chapter\n\nPURPOSE:\n\nTo extend the volunteer firefighters lung benefits.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately and shall expire and be deemed\nrepealed June 30th (2015) 2020.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill will extend the volunteer firefighters lung benefit coverage\nfor conditions of impairment of health caused by diseases of the lung\nthat is set to expire on July 30th, 2015. This proposal would extend\nthe benefit for another 5 years.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
